 "id": 1830860,
 "titulo": "2/18 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1739862037835,
 "modificada": 1743034743576,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1830860",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/39459a175a9c4b0bbbc99637c32378d7_1730183358082_d.jpg\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">Greetings, Agents. </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">In this patch, meet two heroes who will use any means necessary to complete their missions.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:#9900ff\">Winter Soldier</span>, armed with the power of <span style=\"color:#9900ff\">Tier-4</span> to upend the world, </span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\">and <span style=\"color:#9900ff\">Black Widow</span>, now wielding the Symbiote's power, have both received <span style=\"color:#9900ff\">new Uniforms</span>.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated heroes</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">by downloading the 2/18 Patch!</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"color:#740060\">■ 2/18 Patch Details</span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Patch Schedule: 2/19 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 2/18 (Tue) 19:00 (PST)</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff00ff;\">[2/19 (Wed) 2:55&nbsp;(UTC+0), 2/18 (Tue) 18:55&nbsp;(PST) added]</span><br>\nThe patch has been completed as of 2/19 (Wed) 2:55&nbsp;(UTC+0), 2/18 (Tue) 18:55&nbsp;(PST).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">Completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The game can still be accessed during the patch.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">When the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Two New Uniforms</span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Two new Uniforms, Winter Soldier &lt;Revolution&gt;, and Black Widow &lt;Venomus&gt; have been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The skill effects of the Uniform are based on the maximum skill level stats.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The two new Uniforms will be on sale for</span></span> <span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad\">40% off during the (New World Boss &lt;Black Dwarf &amp; Maw&gt; Update Celebration Event)</span></span></span> <span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">and can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and Uniform Room after the Event.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1739770705761\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/0a34dc3b66064db5a74b043859059d8c_1739770705761_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1739770714225\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/50dc7ab12ddf48b992850a42805f6f4d_1739770714225_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Winter Soldier Tier-4</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Tier-4 Advancement has been added to Winter Soldier in order to achieve his desired outcome.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The Tier-4 Striker Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1739770733922\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fc75e4e78b8d47b5a8b23f842da1fdb8_1739770733922_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ New Artifact</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">An Exclusive Passive Skill Artifact for Winter Soldier has been added.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">﻿<span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1739770745954\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d6a32dbfdef049b8980421fade09ddb2_1739770745954_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ New Products</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">New products have been added.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#2980b9\">- The following products are available in the [Store], when certain conditions are met.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#ff008c\">* The price is based on the Google Play Store.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1738818584741\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/089c5289088f4f1f8ecc7d3ea28ab0fa_1738818584741_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1738818593149\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/86f57e24f6584359b71db69170b5a0ee_1738818593149_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><b><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22\">▣ Game Error Fixes</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">1. The number of ISO-8 displayed at the top of the Inventory &lt;ISO-8&gt; category not matching the number shown through the \"?\" button at the bottom of the screen has been fixed.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">2.&nbsp;The issue where Proxima's next attack would not deal any damage after being hit by a specific attack pattern used by Proxima (World Boss: Legend+ &lt;Corvus &amp; Proxima&gt;) in certain situations has been fixed.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background:white\">We look forward to your active participation in the events that will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\">Thank you.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1738818508422\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d09e03623b394a789f531b81e58c03a3_1738818508422_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
}